title: "GH-1443: align item and history union ordering and provenance during lossless merges"
description: "Published 2026.10.10 reporter describes a lossless completed Git merge whose item/history differ in comment order and docs/tests provenance labels, causing hash drift and exact receipt refusal. Reproduce canonical equality before implementation."
